  "body": "Some homes simply offer more - more bedrooms, more living space, more flexibility, more places to entertain. And 99 Grovenor Drive delivers exactly that.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Orewa's highly sought-after pockets, this substantial six-bedroom home has been thoughtfully configured for modern family life. Boasting four bathrooms and multiple separate living spaces, the expansive layout provides genuine separation and independent options for growing families, extended family, teenagers, and guests.\r\n\r\nThe main living area serves as the natural centre of the home: expansive, light-filled, and beautifully updated with quality floor carpets and premium wooden floor coverings. This space connects directly to the ultimate outdoor entertaining zone. A rain-sensor louvre system makes the alfresco area remarkably versatile, while a flat rear lawn-perfect for the kids to kick a ball around-sits alongside a large swim spa. Elevated sea views create an impressive backdrop for any occasion.\r\n\r\nThe primary master suite takes luxury a step further, offering its own entirely separate living area and a private balcony with wide-reaching views across the sea and estuary. It delivers a level of space and privacy rarely found within a typical family home, ensuring everyone in the household has a dedicated place to unwind. Complementing this is a coveted second master suite, also complete with its own private ensuite, providing an ideal setup for extended family or long-term guests.\r\n\r\nQuality is equally evident in the home's mechanical and structural details. A comprehensive climate control setup featuring five heat pumps positioned throughout the home ensures every separate zone stays perfectly warm in the winter and cool in the summer. Additionally, an advanced solar panel system allows for independent generation of highly cost-effective energy, effortlessly offsetting the power consumption of your swim spa, spa, EV charging station, and daily household needs. Complete with underfloor heating, integrated sound systems, and a timeless brick and weatherboard construction, this is a substantial, high-spec build that simply could not be replicated in today's current building cost market.\r\n\r\nPracticality hasn't been overlooked either. Excellent additional off-street parking makes this an ideal proposition for those with a boat, caravan, or multiple vehicles. Families will also appreciate the unbeatable convenience of easy walking proximity to excellent local schools, alongside quick access to Orewa Beach, local amenities, and the motorway.\r\n\r\nIf you've been searching for a home where generous space, distinct living zones, high-end features, and future-proofed efficiency are genuinely part of the package, this is an irreplaceable opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nVisit one of our open homes or to view by appointment call Kylie Settle on 021 996 446 or Jaxon Bonnici on 021 160 0226",
